{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45339","headline":"问遥山禅老 · 皎然","name":"问遥山禅老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天与松子寿，独饮日月精。\n复令颜子贤，胡爲夭其生。\n吾将寻河源，上天问天何不平。\n我将诘仙老，大道无私谁强名。\n仙老难逢天不近，世人何人解应尽。\n明朝欲向翅头山，问取禅公此义还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}